      "content": "REST API for the Dodo Payments merchant-of-record (MoR) platform. Covers products, one-time payments, subscriptions, customers, checkout sessions, discounts, license keys, payouts, refunds, disputes, and webhooks. Dodo Payments acts as the seller of record and handles global sales tax, VAT, and GST calculation, collection, and remittance.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Dodo Payments Support\n Email: support@dodopayments.com",
